-+/*
-+ * WAIT_FOR_SETUP (OUTPKTRDY)
-+ *      - read data packet from EP0 FIFO
-+ *      - decode command
-+ *      - if error
-+ *              set USB_CSR0_SVDOUTPKTRDY | USB_CSR0_DATAEND | USB_CSR0_SENDSTALL bits
-+ *      - else
-+ *              set USB_CSR0_SVDOUTPKTRDY | USB_CSR0_DATAEND bits
